#: ../../tools/pdbe_validation_tools.rst:32 2533ccf764934f578e802d39ee9bd6bf
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get residue-level validation outliers for a PDB "
"structure from PDBe. Identifies specific residues with geometry problems "
"(Ramachandran outliers, sidechain rotamer outliers, bond angle/length "
"deviations). Returns problematic residues organized by molecule/chain. "
"Essential for identifying unreliable regions before using structure data "
"for molecular docking, mutation analysis, or protein engineering. "
"Example: 4HHB has residue-level outliers in chains A-D with rotamer and "
"Ramachandran deviations."
msgstr ""

