#: ../../tools/pdbe_validation_tools.rst:61 c7695cfe7c7545f5881759a37c35d546
msgid "**Name**: ``PDBeValidation_get_quality_scores``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pdbe_validation_tools.rst:63 745ab58ffecc4ed09c124c1049d1e4d7
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get global quality validation scores for a PDB structure"
" from PDBe. Returns percentile rankings for Ramachandran outliers, "
"rotamer outliers, and clashscore. Each metric has a raw value, an "
"absolute percentile (compared to all structures), and a relative "
"percentile (compared to structures at similar resolution). Higher "
"percentile = better quality. Essential for assessing whether a structure "
"is reliable enough for downstream analysis. Example: 4HHB (hemoglobin) "
"has clashscore raw=141.11 (absolute: 0.0%, relative: 0.0% - very poor by "
"modern standards); 1TUP (p53-DNA complex) has similar vintage quality "
"issues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pdbe_validation_tools.rst:67 130e8def2beb49048a10e60196fab9e6
msgid ""
"``pdb_id`` (string) (required) PDB identifier (4-character code). Case-"
"insensitive. Examples: '4hhb' (hemoglobin), '1tup' (p53-DNA), '6lu7' "
"(SARS-CoV-2 main protease)."
msgstr ""

